ters (getting counter information, creating, editing, and deleting); managing goals; managing operations and filters; managing accounts and access; managing delegates (creating, changing, and deleting). To demonstrate the features of the Management API, the reference guide includes examples of interaction with Yandex Metrica. The methods in the examples return sample data that all users can view. Was the article helpful? Yes No Previous Changelog Next Formats for input data and results module = {}; __NONCE__ = \"Zussv9UEKXl7FXZ6lIJlMw==\"; __ENV__ = \"production\"; __DATA__ = {\"err\":null,\"page\":\"/_doc\",\"pathname\":\"dev/metrika/en/management/\",\"query\":{},\"props\":{\"pageProps\":{\"data\":{\"revision\":\"r20856727\",\"docLang\":\"en\",\"docLangs\":[\"ru\",\"en\"],\"docVersion\":null,\"docVersions\":null,\"viewerConfigParams\":{\"buildParams\":{\"strict\":true,\"breaks\":false,\"allowHTML\":true,\"singlePage\":true,\"apply-presets\":true,\"langs\":[\"ru\",\"en\"]},\"project-name\":\"dev-metrika\",\"is-new-external\":true,\"no-index\":false,\"langs\":[\"ru\",\"en\"],\"metrika\":19792447,\"favicon-src\":\"https://yastatic.net/s3/metrika/ui-projects/public/_/favicon.ico\"},\"viewerInterface\":{},\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe Management API gives you access to numerous Yandex Metrica features. For example, you can use it to:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003emanaging counters (getting counter information, creating, editing, and deleting);\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003emanaging goals;\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003emanaging operations and filters;\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003emanaging accounts and access;\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003emanaging delegates (creating, changing, and deleting).\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eTo demonstrate the features of the Management API, the reference guide includes examples of interaction with Yandex Metrica. The methods in the examples return sample data that all user