{"url":"https://yandex.com/dev/market/partner-api/doc/en/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-30T05:32:04.821Z","text":"Yandex Market API for sellers | Yandex.Market API for sellers OpenAPI OpenAPI OpenAPI partner account Yandex Market API OpenAPI Notification API Telegram General description Introduction Preparation for work Step-by-step instructions Overview of methods Feedback API Update History Major updates Outdated methods and parameters All updates The store&#x27;s requests to the Market Offices and shops Products Balances and turnover Prices Stocks Orders Shipments FBS Shortcuts FBS and DBS Requests for supply, export and disposal (FBY, LaaS) DBS-delivery Non-purchases and refunds Reports and documents Product Reviews Questions and answers about products Sales boost Quality index Chats Warehouses Reference books Outdated methods API notifications How to work with notifications Data format Error messages Receiving notifications A module from Yandex.Market For 1C:Company Yandex Market API for sellers Yandex Market API for sellers Yandex Market API It helps sellers manage assortment and prices, process orders, update balances, and solve many other tasks. How to set up integration Read the page Creation and use API-Key-tokens . It tells you how to log in to access resources. Read it connection instructions OpenAPI-Specifications . For sellers of the Yandex Go Market: Read the instructions How to work with Yandex Market API . See the section Step-by-step instructions — if there are instructions for your task, start with it. Open overview of API methods for the desired model and select the ones that are needed to solve the problem. Read the detailed description of each method and implement the integration. If necessary, enable API notifications and Yandex.Market will send you a request with information about the event when it happens. This is an optional integration. However, with the help of notifications, you will be able to quickly respond to changes in orders, non-purchases and refunds, as well as to requests for cancellation of the order. How to enable API notifications Events for which Yandex.Market sends notifications: creating a new order; changing the order; changing the order status; creating a new chat with a customer; adding a new chat message; the beginning of the dispute; ending the dispute; creating a new product review; creating a new review comment; creating an order cancellation request; order cancellation; creating a new non-purchase or refund; changing the non-purchase or refund status. Notifications will also be sent for test orders. Was the article helpful? Yes No Next Authorization module = {}; __NONCE__ = \"M32quS9yJHNzKNX7D5dbHQ==\"; __ENV__ = \"production\"; __DATA__ = {\"err\":null,\"page\":\"/_doc\",\"pathname\":\"dev/market/partner-api/doc/en/\",\"query\":{},\"props\":{\"pageProps\":{\"data\":{\"revision\":\"r20877962\",\"docLang\":\"en\",\"docLangs\":[\"ru\",\"en\",\"zh\"],\"docVersion\":null,\"docVersions\":null,\"viewerConfigParams\":{\"buildParams\":{\"strict\":true,\"allowHTML\":true,\"breaks\":false,\"singlePage\":false,\"langs\":[\"ru\",\"en\",\"zh\"],\"resources\":{\"style\":[\"_assets/style/scheme.css\"]},\"neuroExpert\":{\"projectId\":{\"ru\":\"7df3e51af5d211f0b7bdeab7ff754a80\"}}},\"project-name\":\"dev-market-partner-api\",\"is-external\":true,\"no-index\":false,\"internal-s3\":false,\"langs\":[\"ru\",\"en\",\"zh\"],\"metrika\":95147147,\"favicon-src\":\"https://yastatic.net/s3/doc-binary/src/support/market/ru/logo/favicon.svg\",\"logo-options\":{\"src\":\"https://yastatic.net/s3/doc-binary/src/support/market/ru/logo/favicon.svg\",\"img-has\":{\"height\":\"32px\",\"offset\":true},\"url\":\"./\"},\"index-page\":{\"hidden\":false,\"title\":\"Партнерский API Маркета\",\"description\":\"Внешний партнерский API Яндекс Маркета\"},\"embed\":[{\"host\":\"viewer.ydocs.me\"},{\"host\":\"*.market.yandex.ru\"},{\"host\":\"*.market.fslb.yandex.ru\"},{\"host\":\"*.partner.market.node.*.yandex.ru\"},{\"host\":\"m